WHAT YOU MAY DO WITHOUT ASKING

1. Link to any page of this site freely.

2. Quote a short passage, or use a screenshot of the site or of the mods, in
   a video, an article, a review or a modpack description, as long as the
   source is credited and a link is given.

WHAT YOU MAY NOT DO

1. Copy, republish or mirror these pages, in whole or in part, on another
   site or domain.

2. Reuse the texts, the diagrams, the layout or the code of this site as the
   basis of another site or project.

3. Use the name Tactile, the names of its modules, its logos or its visual
   identity to name, brand or promote another project.

The mods themselves are covered by their own licence, published with each
mod on its CurseForge page.

Any use not granted above requires written permission from the author.
